1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,429
Close to six months with one employer?

2
00:00:02,429 --> 00:00:05,941
On a working holiday visa, your job might be exempt.

3
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:09,899
One. The default rule is six months' work with any one employer.

4
00:00:09,899 --> 00:00:13,150
It counts the months since you started, not your hours.

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,725
Two. Some sectors are exempt right now,

6
00:00:15,725 --> 00:00:19,008
including tourism and hospitality, agriculture,

7
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:21,129
health, aged care and childcare.

8
00:00:21,129 --> 00:00:23,413
Same employer, different locations?

9
00:00:23,413 --> 00:00:26,998
You can stay longer if each location is six months or less.

10
00:00:27,098 --> 00:00:28,601
Three. Not exempt?

11
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:32,362
You'd need permission, and it's only given in limited cases.

12
00:00:32,462 --> 00:00:34,818
Save this before you sign your next job.

